    <bpmn2:collaboration id="Collaboration_1" name="Default Collaboration">
        <bpmn2:documentation id="Documentation_1766045804289" textFormat="text/plain">Headers that can be passed from the Interface-Specific IFlow and they will have a priority:
1) XI Scenario related:
SAP_SenderParty
SAP_Sender
SAP_ReceiverParty
SAP_Receiver
SAP_ReceiverInterface
SAP_ReceiverInterfaceNamespace
SapQualityOfService
SapQueueId
UniqueID
2) Connectivity related:
SAP_Receiver_XIEndpoint
SAP_Receiver_XICCLocationId
SAP_Receiver_XICredentialName
SAP_Receiver_XIPrivateKeyAlias
SAP_Receiver_XIProxyType
SAP_Receiver_XIAuthenticationType</bpmn2:documentation>
